This is the global changelog, which lists every version (starting from 0.4.1)
======== 0.4.1 ========
 - Added this changelog file (can be viewed with command "about whatsnew")
 - Added return on return command (which terminate the launcher after executing a last command)
 - Added a lot of other argument-based features (like the ability to launch commands directly from bash) and a setting linked to those
 - Added a way to view the log file directly in the launcher ("about log" command)
 - Fixed bugs (kinda)
 - Did not added comments in version.sh